    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3639" root="بيض" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبِيضَةٌ</span></b>  A woman <i>who brings forth white children:</i>
the contr. is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْوِدَةٌ</span>: (Fr, K:) but <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوضِحَةٌ</span>
is more commonly used in the former sense. (O.)

